<http://data.silknow.org/object/0f8133e1-d253-32c8-9fe5-c4f3f2529ea2>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Woman's surcoat of embroidered silk gauze, China, late 18th century"@en , "Lady's surcoat of dark blue embroidered gauze over green silk. The coat is embroidered with green, pink, blue, yellow, brown silks, and gilt thread in satin stitch, French knots and couched work. The design shows eight floral circles: three on the front, three behind and one on each shoulder. There is a design of waves and mountain at the bottom.\n\nThe garment has a silk lining which was added later."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/5381208a-5f61-3e19-aa76-2f6c7f9d5cf3> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Woman's surcoat of embroidered silk gauze, China, late 18th century"@en , "Lady's surcoat of dark blue embroidered gauze over green silk. The coat is embroidered with green, pink, blue, yellow, brown silks, and gilt thread in satin stitch, French knots and couched work. The design shows eight floral circles: three on the front, three behind and one on each shoulder. There is a design of waves and mountain at the bottom.\n\nThe garment has a silk lining which was added later."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/0f8133e1-d253-32c8-9fe5-c4f3f2529ea2/dimension/1> ;
